ills card when the MCP server is already added"},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAddButton:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAddButton",defaultMessage:"Add",description:"Label will be shown inside Skills card when the MCP server is not added, this is a button that will open a link"},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestButton:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestButton",defaultMessage:"Request",description:"Label shown inside an MCP server card for users who cannot add MCP servers (e.g. non-org admin). Clicking it opens a modal to submit a request to their organization admin to enable the MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestedButton:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionRequestedButton",defaultMessage:"Requested",description:"Label shown inside an MCP server card once the user (who cannot add MCP servers) has already requested this MCP server from their organization admin."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAlreadyRequestedTooltip:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryDescriptionAlreadyRequestedTooltip",defaultMessage:"This MCP server has already been requested",description:"Tooltip shown on the disabled Request button inside an MCP server card when the user has already requested this MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCanAdd:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCanAdd",defaultMessage:"Add a new MCP server",description:"Title of the Custom MCP Server CTA card for users who can add MCP servers, shown in the card directory. The card will act as a way for user to go to admin hub to add a custom MCP server."},mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCannotAdd:{id:"agent-studio-tools.mcp-discovery-gallery.mcpDiscoveryGalleryCTACardTitleCannotAdd",defaultMessage:"Can't find an MCP server?",description:"Title of the Custom MCP Server CTA card for users who cannot add MCP se